[SIZE=5][B]OpenCredits — open-source credits for XenForo 2.3+[/B][/SIZE]

A free (MIT) credits system for XenForo 2.3+. Reward activity, show balances,
let members transfer and redeem credits, and gate trophies on wealth.

[B]Highlights[/B]
[LIST]
[*] [B]Earn on activity[/B] — threads, replies, reactions, registrations and daily visits, with amounts, daily caps, and forum/group scoping.
[*] [B]Multiple currencies[/B] — a primary currency plus per-currency visibility.
[*] [B]Wallet everywhere[/B] — postbit, account menu, profiles, and paged history; your own profile also has a transfer shortcut.
[*] [B]Transfers & redeem codes[/B] — member-to-member transfers that never overdraw, plus single/multi-use coupon codes.
[*] [B]Leaderboard[/B] — a placeable "Top credit holders" widget with a configurable count and currency.
[*] [B]Alerts & trophies[/B] — optional alerts when credits land, and "has at least / fewer than X credits" criteria for trophies, notices, and promotions.
[/LIST]

[B]For admins[/B]
[LIST]
[*] Manage currencies, earning events, codes, and members from [B]AdminCP → Credits[/B] (gated by the [I]Manage credits[/I] admin permission; super admins always have it).
[*] Tools to adjust balances, rebuild from the ledger, backfill pre-install content, and prune old history into snapshots.
[*] Display toggles (postbit, menu, profile) and a configurable daily boundary (UTC, board time, or a fixed offset).
[*] Spend/award API and an [ICODE]oc_credits_adjust[/ICODE] event — see [ICODE]docs/API.md[/ICODE] on GitHub.
[/LIST]

Defaults: thread $5, reply $1, reaction $2, registration $10, daily visit $5 — change anytime in AdminCP → Credits.

[B]Requirements[/B]

XenForo 2.3.0+, PHP 8.2+, MySQL 8.0+. No other add-ons required.

[B]Install[/B]

Grab the zip from the [URL=https://github.com/techwiz18/open-credits/releases]releases page[/URL], then pick one:
[LIST]
[*] [B]From AdminCP[/B] — Add-ons → [B]Install from archive[/B], upload the zip, click [B]Install[/B].
[*] [B]Manual[/B] — unzip it and upload the contents of [ICODE]upload/[/ICODE] into your forum root, then AdminCP → Add-ons → OpenCredits → [B]Install[/B].
[/LIST]
Then allow [B]View own credit wallet and history[/B] and [B]Transfer credits to other users[/B] for Registered (and any other groups) on the Credits permission tab. Members start earning on their next post/reaction/visit.

To upgrade later: upload the newer zip and click [B]Upgrade[/B] on the add-on.

[B]Troubleshooting[/B]
[LIST]
[*] [B]Wrong balances?[/B] — AdminCP → Credits → Rebuild balances (or CLI: [ICODE]php cmd.php oc-credits:rebuild[/ICODE]).
[*] [B]Permission errors?[/B] — check the Credits permission tab per group (fresh installs auto-allow Registered).
[*] [B]Uninstalling wipes data[/B] — balances, ledger, events, currencies, codes, and snapshots.
[/LIST]

